      <VERS vnumber="15">And ye shall <gr str="5608">count </gr>to you from the next <gr str="4283">day </gr>after the <gr str="7676">sabbath</gr>, from the <gr str="3117">day </gr>that ye <gr str="935">brought </gr>the <gr str="6016">sheaf </gr>of the wave <gr str="8573">offering</gr>; <gr str="7651">seven </gr>
